      "content": "Main parts of a cell:"
    },
    {
      "type": "pullQuote",
      "content": "The cell is the basic structural, functional, and biological unit of all known living organisms.",
      "id": "u9bytzx"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 4,
      "id": "tw5pn0e",
      "content": "• Cell membrane"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 4,
      "id": "2o2vixv",
      "content": "• Cytoplasm"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 4,
      "id": "5ltk6mh",
      "content": "• Nucleus"
    },
    {
      "id": "t562e7n",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": "5. Cell Membrane"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "dbjhwh0",
      "content": "• Also called plasma membrane."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "0rkceq7",
      "content": "• Controls movement of substances into and out of the cell."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "6e6vki1",
      "content": "• It is selectively permeable."
    },
